hadiths[15]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1249","Maimoon bin Mehran rehmatullah alaih se riwayat hai unhon ne farmaya main ne Nafe rehmatullah alaih se poocha kya Hazrat Ibn Umar raziyallahu anhuma logon ko khane par bulaya karte the unhon ne kaha ye un ka mamool na tha lekin un ke ek oont ki taang toot gayi to hum ne use zibah kar diya phir unhon ne kaha Madina walon ko jama karo Nafe ne kaha to main ne kaha ai Abu Abdur Rahman main unhen kis cheez par bulaun hamare paas roti nahin hai to unhon ne kaha ai Allah tamam tareef Tere hi liye hai ye haddiyan aur shorba hai ya kaha shorba aur gosht hai jo chahe khaye aur jo chahe chhor de."
"1250","Hazrat Abu Huraira raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya Ibrahim sallallahu alaihi wasallam ka khatna assi baras ki umar ke baad kiya gaya unhon ne khud qadum se khatna kiya Imam Bukhari rehmatullah alaih ne farmaya qadum koi jagah nahin hai lekin is se murad assi hai."
"1251","Ummul Muhajir rehmatullah alaih se riwayat hai unhon ne farmaya mujhe Room ki qaidi aurton me se laya gaya to Hazrat Usman raziyallahu anhu ne hamen Islam ki dawat di to mere aur ek doosri aurat ke siwa koi Musalman na hua to Hazrat Usman raziyallahu anhu ne farmaya jao in aurton ka khatna karo aur unhen paak karo."
"1252","Salim rehmatullah alaih se riwayat hai unhon ne farmaya mujhe aur Nuaim ko Hazrat Ibn Umar raziyallahu anhuma ne khatna kiya to hamari taraf se ek mendha zibah kiya gaya to hum is baat par ladkon par fakhr karte the ke hamari taraf se mendha zibah kiya gaya tha."
"1253","Umm Alqama raziyallahu anha se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Ayesha raziyallahu anha ki bhanjiyon ka khatna kiya gaya to Hazrat Ayesha raziyallahu anha se kaha gaya kya hum un ke liye use na bulayen jo unhen behlaye to unhon ne farmaya haan to Adi ki taraf paigham bheja gaya to wo aaya to Hazrat Ayesha raziyallahu anha us ke paas se guzrin to unhon ne use dekha ke wo ga raha tha aur naach raha tha aur bahut balon wala tha to Hazrat Ayesha raziyallahu anha ne farmaya uff is shaitan ko nikalo ise nikal do."
"1254","Aslam maula Umar rehmatullah alaih se riwayat hai unhon ne farmaya jab hum Hazrat Umar bin Khattab raziyallahu anhu ke sath Sham aaye to un ke paas us mulk ka sardar aaya to us ne kaha ai Ameerul Momineen main ne aap ke liye khana tayyar kiya hai aur main chahta hun ke aap mere ghar tashreef layen aur aap ke sath aap ke muazziz sathiyon me se chand afraad hon ye mere liye taqat aur izzat ka bais hoga to Hazrat Umar raziyallahu anhu ne farmaya hum tumhare in girja gharon me dakhil nahin hote jin me ye tasveeren hon."
"1255","Umm Muhajir rehmatullah alaiha se riwayat hai unhon ne farmaya mujhe aur laundiyon me se chand aurton ko sarzameen Room se qaid karke laya gaya to Hazrat Usman raziyallahu anhu ne hamen Islam ki dawat di to main aur mere ilawa ek aurat Musalman ho gayi aur hamare ilawa koi Musalman na hua to Hazrat Usman raziyallahu anhu ne farmaya in dono aurton ko khatna karo aur pak karo unhon ne farmaya phir main Hazrat Usman raziyallahu anhu ki khidmat karti thi."
"1256","Hazrat Abu Huraira raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai unhon ne farmaya Ibrahim alaihis salam ka khatna kiya gaya jab un ki umar ek sau bees baras thi phir us ke baad wo sau baras zinda rahe aur Saeed rehmatullah alaih ne farmaya Ibrahim alaihis salam sab se pehle hain jin ka khatna kiya gaya aur sab se pehle hain jinhon ne mehman ki mezbani ki aur sab se pehle hain jinhon ne moonchhen katin aur nakhun tarashe aur sab se pehle hain jin ke baal safed hue to unhon ne kaha ai mere Rab ye kya hai to Allah Taala ne farmaya ye waqar hai to Ibrahim alaihis salam ne kaha ai mere Rab mere waqar me izafa farma."
"1257","Hasan Basri rehmatullah alaih se riwayat hai unhon ne farmaya kya tumhen Malik bin Munzir par taajjub nahin hota wo Room me dehqanon me se naye Musalman hone wale nau Musalmanon ki talash me nikla to us ne un ka muaina kiya aur sardiyon me un ke khatne ka hukm diya jabke zakhm takleef deta hai to mujhe khabar pahunchi ke un me se baaz mar gaye aur jab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke daur me Roomi aur Habshi Musalman hue to un ke ahwal me se kisi cheez ki jaanch na ki gayi."
"1258","Ibn Shihab Zuhri rehmatullah alaih se riwayat hai unhon ne farmaya jab koi shakhs Musalman hota to use khatne ka hukm diya jata agarche wo badi umar ka hota."
"1259","Farwah bin Abil Maghra ne ham se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Ibrahim bin Mukhtar ne hamen khabar di Maroof bin Suhail Burjumi se Jafar bin Abil Mughira se unhon ne kaha Saeed bin Jubair mere han utre to unhon ne kaha mujh se Hazrat Ibn Abbas ne bayan kiya ke kaha jata tha oont ke juari kahan hain to das afraad jama hote to wo doodh chhurane ke waqt tak das chhote oonton ke ewaz oont khareedte phir teer pherte to wo nau ke liye ho jata yahan tak ke ek ki taraf ho jata aur doosre sab doodh chhurane tak ek ek chhota oont tawaan dete to yehi maisir hai."
"1260","Uwaisi ne ham se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Sulaiman bin Bilal ne ham se bayan kiya Musa bin Uqba se Nafe se Hazrat Ibn Umar se unhon ne kaha maisir juwa hai."
"1261","Ibrahim bin al-Munzir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ma'n ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn al-Munkadir ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Rabi'a bin Abdullah bin al-Hudair bin Abdullah se riwayat kiya ke do aadmiyon ne Hazrat Umar ke daur me do murghon par shart lagayi to Umar ne murghon ko qatl karne ka hukm diya to Ansar me se ek aadmi ne un se kaha kya tum tasbeeh karne wali ek ummat ko qatl karoge to unhon ne un ko chhor diya."
"1262","Yahya bin Bukair ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Laith ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Uqail se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, mujhe Humaid bin Abdur Rahman ne khabar di ke Abu Huraira ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya tum me se jo shakhs qasam khaye phir apni qasam me kahe Lat aur Uzza ki qasam to use chahiye ke kahe La ilaha illallah aur jo shakhs apne sathi se kahe aao main tum se jua khelta hun to use chahiye ke sadqa kare."
"1263","Amr bin Zurara ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Marwan bin Muawiya ne humein khabar di, unhon ne Umar bin Hamza al-Umari se, unhon ne Husain bin Mus'ab se riwayat kiya ke ek aadmi ne Abu Huraira se kaha hum do kabutaron par shart lagate hain phir hum un dono ke darmiyan muhallil muqarrar karna napasand karte hain is dar se ke muhallil use le jayega to Abu Huraira ne kaha ye bachchon ke kaamon me se hai aur qareeb hai ke tum use chhor doge."
